                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "message": {
            "text": "Hardcoded credential in source: DEFAULT_DATABASE_URL embeds username svc_user and password sup3r-s3cret-p4ssw0rd, and is the fallback used at main.rs:15 when DATABASE_URL is unset. It is permanent in git history; anyone with repo access gains DB credentials. Fix: delete the constant, require DATABASE_URL (exit with a clear message if missing), rotate the exposed password, and inject secrets via env/secret manager."
          },
          "ruleId": "hardcoded-secret"
        },
